    <fields>
        <fullName>Property_Type__c</fullName>
        <description>Business Park –  
Cluster of office buildings, not intended for retail businesses

Industrial –  
Warehouses, workshops, distribution centers, or manufacturing facilities

Medical –  
Hospital campuses, clinics, or office complexes dedicated to healthcare

Mixed Use –  
Developments combining residential, office, and/or retail spaces

Self Storage –  
Facilities with multiple rentable storage units for personal or business use

Shopping Plaza –  
Enclosed malls or large open-air centers with multiple retail/service tenants

Strip Mall –  
Linear retail complexes with side-by-side storefronts and shared parking

Other –  
Does not fit standard complex types</description>
        <externalId>false</externalId>
        <inlineHelpText>•	Business Park: Office use only  
•	Government / Municipal: City/fire/public buildings  
•	Hotel: Lodging  
•	Industrial: Warehouses, workshops  
•	Medical: Clinics, hospitals  
•	Mixed Use: Residential + retail/office  
•	Other: Doesn’t fit other types  
•	Restaurant: Food service buildings  
•	Self Storage: Rentable storage units  
•	Shopping Plaza: Enclosed/multi-building retail  
•	Strip Mall: Linear storefronts</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Property Type</label>
        <required>false</required>
        <trackHistory>false</trackHistory>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
